WEBVTT

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:26.210
ashita he tsuzuku sakamichi no tochuu de

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:26.210
On the uphill road that leads to tomorrow

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:32.510
surechigau otona tachi wa tsubuyaku no sa

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:32.510
We pass by adults who tell us this

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.640
"ai toka yume toka risou mo wakaru kedo

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.640
"I can understand ideals such as love and dreams

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:43.810
me no mae no genjitsu wa sonna ni amaku nai" tte

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:43.810
but the real world isn't as easy as you think"

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:50.150
tsumazuki nagara mo korogari nagara mo

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:50.150
Even though we keep tripping and falling

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:55.360
kasabuta darake no jyounetsu wo wasuretaku nai

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:55.360
We have to remember these pains of growing up

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:58.830
otona ni narenai bokura no

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:58.830
For all of us who can't force ourselves to do so yet

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.330
tsuyogari wo hitotsu kiite kure

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.330
Listen to this one thing I have to say

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:04.540
nige mo kakure mo shinai kara

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:04.540
I won't run or cower away

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:07.460
waraitai yatsu dake warae

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:07.460
So whoever wants to laugh at me, go ahead

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:10.250
semete tayori nai bokura no

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:10.250
Since we can't be relied upon yet

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:12.800
jiyuu no me wo tsumitoranai de

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:12.800
Don't take away our seed of freedom

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.800
mizu wo ageru sono yakume wo

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.800
The task of nurturing this plant

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:18.890
hataseba iindarou?

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:18.890
That's all we have to do, right?

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:30.020
{Intro}

00:01:31.270 --> 00:01:32.280
Gash!

00:01:34.570 --> 00:01:37.570
Please! Help her!
Help Koruru!

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:39.530
What? Koruru?

00:01:40.120 --> 00:01:41.160
This demon?

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:43.330
Koruru!

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:48.630
Damn it.

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:58.800
But, Gash... I can't take it anymore!

00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:02.600
This girl really wants to stay in this world.

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:04.470
But, for the sake of everyone else,

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:07.270
she's desperately holding back.

00:02:07.270 --> 00:02:08.440
That settles it...

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:10.190
Zakeru...

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:15.820
Gash... and everyone else, thank you.

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:20.160
If you become the ruler
of the demon world,

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:23.910
maybe we won't need to
fight like this anymore.

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:32.670
Koruru!

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:42.140
{Part A}

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:50.600
The Third Technique, Jikerudo

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:52.980
Gash! Hey! Wake up!

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:54.110
This is great!

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:56.570
Eh? What is it?

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:58.280
The next page...!

00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:01.530
I can read the next page
of the red book!

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:03.660
It's a new spell!

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:06.830
We did it!

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:08.960
Now, we have one more spell available!

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:11.080
This is so cool!

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:13.210
I wonder what kind of spell
it is... Let's try it!

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:15.420
Kiyomaro, I...

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:21.010
Do you think that spell can
make me a little stronger?

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:27.770
I've thought about becoming the king,

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:30.270
but I never thought I could
actually do it.

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:33.020
But then...

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:35.690
When I saw Koruru cry,

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:37.530
and disappear...

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:41.030
It was frustrating!

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:43.530
I'm so small...

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:47.290
So small that I couldn't do anything!

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:49.660
It was extremely frustrating!

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:52.540
Kiyomaro...

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:56.250
I want to become stronger.

00:03:57.750 --> 00:04:00.510
Will that spell help me become stronger?

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:05.180
Yes! You'll become stronger!

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:06.890
We'll do some special training, Gash!

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:08.680
We'll try out the third spell!

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:09.640
Yeah!

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:18.980
So, this is Mochinoki.

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:20.530
Our opponent is here...

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:23.820
Yes. I've sensed his power many times.

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:26.620
Hey, kid! What about the bill?

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:29.870
You rode here all the way from Shikoku.
You think this was for free?

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:29.870
Note: Shikoku is about 450 miles from Tokyo.

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:31.410
Noisy bastard...

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:33.370
Just a weak old man.

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:37.040
Uigaru!

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:44.680
This power is pretty cool!
It's so exhilarating!

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:47.760
Just using it shut him up real quick.

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:50.310
Nobody can stand in our way.

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:52.730
Monsters!

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:58.650
All we need now is more power
and we'll be set. Right, Fein?

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:02.570
Exactly, and then I shall become king.

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:06.700
I'll gain more power, and become
a ruler that no one can disobey.

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:09.450
And, what about that guy's power?

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:14.500
I felt a powerful wave earlier, but
now, it is barely noticeable.

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:18.040
From his power level, it seems like
he's only defeated ten opponents.

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.960
So, all we have to do is find him.

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:22.710
Yes. I've already started searching.

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:26.970
If he uses his power,
we'll know soon enough.

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:33.430
All right!
This is a good spot.

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:37.650
Even if lightning stronger than Zakeru
comes out, the damage will be minimal.

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:41.730
The third spell. What on
earth could it possibly do?

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:46.700
All right, Gash! Let's go!

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:47.740
Yeah!

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:00.210
The third spell!

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:01.840
Jikerudo!

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:19.730
What the... Nothing happened.

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:22.150
That can't be!

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:24.980
The spell is Ji-ke-ru-do, right?

00:06:25.490 --> 00:06:27.700
One more time, Gash!

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:29.160
Jikerudo!

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:35.950
Why didn't anything happen?
Did I make a mistake?

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:53.100
Er... No, Kiyomaro!

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:56.640
That's not it. I don't
think that's the problem!

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:59.190
I-I know.

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:00.480
I was just trying it.

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:04.520
It's from the heart, right?
I have to read it with feeling. I've got it.

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:06.530
Are you being serious?

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:12.450
That's it! I need to think of
that stone as a bad demon.

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:15.030
Evil...

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:19.080
Evil...

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:21.870
Evil...!

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:24.540
Jikerudo!

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:45.770
Cafe Mochinoki

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:45.770
How is it coming?
Did you find them, Fein?

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:48.860
I'm still searching. I feel
absolutely no power.

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:52.200
It might be that he
doesn't use spells often.

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:54.870
If that's the case, we'll just have
to be patient and wait.

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:57.740
Unless they flee the city,
we're sure to run into them.

00:07:58.080 --> 00:07:59.080
You think so?

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:04.750
Yes, not only because of my ability
to sense anyone using spells.

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:09.260
As long as you're carrying one of these
books, you cannot escape from a fight.

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:11.760
Even if they were on the
opposite side of the Earth,

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:16.180
somehow, someday...
we will run into them.

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:21.140
Look here...

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:23.520
Even without using their powers,

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:26.360
our meeting place has been decided.

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:28.570
Kiyomaro...

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:33.950
Am I just a failure like Brago said?

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:37.620
Will I ever get stronger?

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:39.950
I-Idiot, it's not that at all!

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:41.790
We're just in bad shape today.

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:44.540
We'll practice again tomorrow,
and it'll definitely work!

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:51.260
But... why? Why didn't it work?

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:54.970
Other than having to read it with emotion,
is there a special way to pronounce it?

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:56.260
Uigaru!

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:02.980
He's here! The book owner!

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:05.560
Damn! Those bastards!

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:07.650
In the middle of the city like this?!

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:09.980
Now then, kindly let us burn that book.

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:12.030
I am the one who will become king.

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:14.780
King?

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:18.160
Ouch...

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:24.330
This guy? King?

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:26.250
Gash! We're leaving!

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:28.460
We've got to find a place without people!

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:31.920
Move it! How long are you
going to sleep there?!

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:33.460
They'll get away!

00:09:36.380 --> 00:09:39.350
If you become the ruler
of the demon world,

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:43.430
maybe we won't need to
fight like this anymore.

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:53.610
An abandoned building?

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:56.570
All right. We won't have to worry
about hurting the public here.

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:58.110
We'll take them on in here, Ga--!

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:00.070
Gash...

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:04.000
Trying to hide in a place like this?!

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:07.170
No matter where you run,
we'll kill you!

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:09.580
Hey! You demon!

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:17.380
What is it?

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:23.600
You're not fighting to become
a kind ruler, are you?

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:36.360
Just what does he think he's suggesting?

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:37.780
Become a "kind" ruler?

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:41.240
You simpleton.
There's no point in that!

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:48.120
Once I am king, no one will oppose me!

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:51.830
If anyone complains, I'll
beat them into the ground!

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:55.630
Both the strong and the weak
will submit to my every whim!

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:57.720
No one will complain!

00:10:57.720 --> 00:10:59.720
It will be glorious.

00:11:00.180 --> 00:11:03.010
That's how it will be!

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:08.020
I see...

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:10.390
I understand now!

00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:18.280
If that's how it is, then there's
no way I'm losing this fight!

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:22.030
There's no way I'm
letting you become king!

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:24.490
Kiyomaro! Help me out!

00:11:24.490 --> 00:11:26.950
I won't be defeated by these guys!

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:29.250
Definitely!

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:45.010
{Part B}

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:04.410
Kiyomaro! I won't let this
bastard become the king!

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:07.370
Definitely!

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:10.410
Zakeru!

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:14.330
Uruku!

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:23.510
Did we get them?

00:12:27.350 --> 00:12:28.430
The demon is gone!

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:30.520
I'm right here.

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:33.020
When did he...?

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:34.020
Uigaru!

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:50.830
Didn't you just say you
wouldn't let me become king?

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:51.870
Again?!

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:55.250
What's wrong?
You look confused.

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:57.380
Gash! Let's run for it!

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.010
What the...

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:05.890
Could it be... that he can teleport?

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:08.350
No, that's not it!

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:13.270
His feet... they look like the tracks from a car
that suddenly slammed on its brakes.

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:15.310
That's not teleportation!

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:17.560
It's ultra-high speed movement!

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:19.900
Hey! What's wrong?

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:22.110
You're all silent...
Did you give up already?

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:23.110
Damn it!

00:13:23.110 --> 00:13:24.110
Zakeru!

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:26.240
Moron...

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:29.950
Haven't you realized that
your attacks are useless?!

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:33.830
They're gone!

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:42.590
I underestimated them.

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:46.470
This is going unexpectedly, even
for a fight between demons.

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:47.890
Man! This sucks!

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:52.010
Over there, Gash. To that corner...

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:53.060
Okay.

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:55.730
Right now, we have two spells we can use.

00:13:55.730 --> 00:13:58.770
Zakeru's lightning, and
Rashirudo to block attacks.

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:02.070
Other than that, there's the
recently-discovered third spell, but...

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:05.400
I can't use a spell that
we've never gotten to work.

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:09.030
We have to win this fight using
only Zakeru and Rashirudo!

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:11.280
Are you okay, Kiyomaro?

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:12.740
All right! Here is fine.

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:17.790
I took a bit of a serious blow, but I'm okay.

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:22.840
More importantly, Gash, do you remember
the formation from the botanical garden?

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:24.300
We'll use it again!

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:27.510
It's a gamble, but we can
finish this in one blow!

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:34.850
We won't let that bastard become
the ruler of your world!

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:36.390
Right, Gash?

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:37.890
Yeah!

00:14:38.140 --> 00:14:40.350
That's right, Kiyomaro!

00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:44.190
Where did you think you were going?

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:46.030
The corner of the roof?

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:48.780
To run to a place where you can't escape...

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:51.070
you're even dumber than I thought!

00:14:51.070 --> 00:14:52.070
Uruku!

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:54.620
Yeah, this is the corner of the roof.

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:57.620
But if you can't pass the boundary right
in front of you, you can't reach us!

00:14:57.620 --> 00:14:58.960
That boundary is...

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:00.460
The second spell!

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:01.670
Rashirudo!

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:04.460
With Rashirudo, we'll make a wall.

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:07.840
Foolish!

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:10.890
You thought you could shamelessly
stick a wall like this in front of me?

00:15:10.890 --> 00:15:14.140
Right. If you can't go through
the wall, you go over it.

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:15.390
That's what I wanted!

00:15:15.390 --> 00:15:17.810
In midair, you can't
make any sudden turns!

00:15:17.810 --> 00:15:18.850
Ready!

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:19.890
This is it.

00:15:19.890 --> 00:15:20.810
Zakeru!

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:25.520
Uigaru!

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:28.650
He dodged it?

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:33.320
I guess I was too hasty, but
he was close to the target!

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:38.160
Damn! Our last chance...

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:42.250
If we could limit his movement, we'd
be able to attack him, but...

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:43.880
Out of energy?!

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:45.290
Uigaru!

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:46.210
Are we done for?

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:50.300
There's no way we can lose...

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:52.180
Kiyomaro!

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:55.640
Gash!

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:02.650
You idiot!
Why did you do that?!

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:04.860
What are you saying?

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:07.530
My body's strong,
so I'm protecting you!

00:16:07.530 --> 00:16:09.110
Isn't that obvious?

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:10.360
And also...

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:15.570
You said you wouldn't let that bastard
become the king, right?

00:16:15.570 --> 00:16:16.830
Gash!

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:20.540
So, I'll be your shield to the end!

00:16:20.960 --> 00:16:24.420
Until you defeat those guys!

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:30.420
Thank you, kind bro!

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:41.980
That's right!
This isn't over yet!

00:16:43.140 --> 00:16:45.900
We can still cast spells!

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:50.690
If I just think of another way
to stop that bastard's feet...!

00:16:52.650 --> 00:16:55.990
And also, we still have that third spell!

00:16:58.080 --> 00:17:00.370
Now we've got something
more than a simulation!

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:01.750
Let's go, Gash!

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:03.250
Let's totally annihilate them!

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:05.710
Even if the third spell is no good,

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:09.800
we'll keep casting spells until
our hearts run out of energy!

00:17:09.800 --> 00:17:10.710
Yeah!

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:18.930
No matter what...

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:23.060
No matter what, we'll win!

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:27.520
- Still going at it?
- It's useless.

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:29.150
Uruku!

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:30.730
The third spell,

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:32.110
Jikerudo!

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:34.900
A new spell?

00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:36.030
It came out!

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:41.240
W-What is that?

00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:42.620
A slow sphere of light?

00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:44.370
You thought that would do something?

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:46.580
Are you trying to insult me?

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:49.880
Wha! What's this?

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:52.960
Huh? The light sphere faded away,

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:55.170
but the demon's body started glowing!

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:57.590
You bastards!
What did you do to me?

00:17:57.590 --> 00:18:00.930
M-My body won't go forwa...!

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:11.570
M-My body's stuck to a water tower...

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:15.860
This is... Does the third
spell restrain the opponent?

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:19.820
No. If that was it, then why didn't
it come out during practice?

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:21.280
Why did it work now?

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:27.460
The steel pipes and nails
are sticking to him!

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:32.710
Could it be that the third spell
magnetizes the opponent?

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:34.880
That's it!

00:18:34.880 --> 00:18:38.180
During practice, there weren't
any metal objects around.

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:41.890
And now, there's a steel
water tower close by!

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:46.350
Honestly, to think that there
are conditional spells...

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:48.690
Uruku! Ukuru!

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:50.520
Damn it! What did you do?

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:52.150
Uruku!

00:18:54.150 --> 00:18:59.410
Anyway, we managed to stop this
guy from becoming the king.

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:05.790
You gave it your best, Gash.

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:07.910
What are you saying?

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:09.670
Not as much as you, Kiyomaro...

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:19.470
Well, the only thing left is...

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:23.720
Damn!

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:30.980
Koruru...

00:19:35.730 --> 00:19:36.940
Hey, Gash...

00:19:38.240 --> 00:19:41.990
I wonder if all demons are like that.

00:19:42.280 --> 00:19:43.870
No way!

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:46.990
There are demons like the kind Koruru!

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:50.000
Yeah, well...

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:53.790
That's not exactly what
I was trying to say...

00:20:00.170 --> 00:20:02.340
Become even stronger!

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:06.470
I'll try my best, too.

00:20:06.470 --> 00:20:09.140
That way, we'll become
stronger together!

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:12.100
Kiyo...maro...

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:15.310
I hope you become the king.

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:17.690
If you become strong, someday...

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:21.490
I'll become the king...?

00:20:22.610 --> 00:20:25.950
Yes, the kind ruler...

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:33.210
The kind ruler...

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:35.670
If I become stronger...

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:37.000
Can I do it?

00:20:38.590 --> 00:20:41.090
Yes! You definitely can!

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:50.890
Yes! I'll become a kind ruler!

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:52.810
Yeah!

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:56.650
Until then, please do your best!

00:20:59.730 --> 00:21:00.780
Yeah!

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:05.030
{Ending}

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:20.750
ne konna koto tsuzukete itemo

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:20.750
You know, even if we continue to progress like this

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:25.970
shiawase wa mitsukaru no kana?

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:25.970
Will we be able to find true happiness?

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:31.100
tarinai mono kazoete mitemo

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:31.100
When I try counting what is missing in my life

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:36.230
kiri ga nai no wakatteru you

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:36.230
I know the list will keep going on and on

00:21:36.770 --> 00:21:41.900
shinario douri nante

00:21:36.770 --> 00:21:41.900
Everything goes according to plans

00:21:42.190 --> 00:21:46.660
umaku iku wake nai kara

00:21:42.190 --> 00:21:46.660
Of course that can never happen

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:49.280
toki ni wa zenbu

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:49.280
At times, everything that I have

00:21:49.620 --> 00:21:52.120
nagedashi taku naru

00:21:49.620 --> 00:21:52.120
I just want to let it all go

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:57.920
sonna hi ga attemo iiyone

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:57.920
Is it uncommon to have days like this?

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:05.470
hito wa mina okubyou dakara

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:05.470
Everyone is afraid, even though we don't show it

00:22:05.670 --> 00:22:10.010
yume wo miru no kana?

00:22:05.670 --> 00:22:10.010
Is that why we dream?

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:15.850
hito wa mina kodoku dakara

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:15.850
Everyone feels lonely on the inside

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:20.360
ai wo sagasu no kana?

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:20.360
Is that why we look for love?

00:22:20.860 --> 00:22:23.400
kitto chigau

00:22:20.860 --> 00:22:23.400
Even though you are not here

00:22:23.530 --> 00:22:25.780
basho de kimi mo

00:22:23.530 --> 00:22:25.780
know that where ever you are

00:22:26.240 --> 00:22:27.950
onaji tsuki wo

00:22:26.240 --> 00:22:27.950
You are gazing up

00:22:28.160 --> 00:22:31.620
miteru you ne...

00:22:28.160 --> 00:22:31.620
at the same moon as me...

00:22:35.040 --> 00:22:35.080
{Preview}

00:22:38.170 --> 00:22:40.750
That demon's scaring the whole town!

00:22:40.750 --> 00:22:41.880
That can't be!

00:22:41.880 --> 00:22:43.550
He's a good guy!

00:22:43.550 --> 00:22:46.300
But, he's trying to destroy
the elementary school!

00:22:46.300 --> 00:22:47.380
Let's go, Gash!

00:22:47.380 --> 00:22:50.220
How many spells does that guy have?

00:22:50.220 --> 00:22:51.470
It's terrible, Gash!

00:22:51.470 --> 00:22:55.100
Playing with a person's heart like
that, I'll never forgive him!

00:22:55.100 --> 00:22:59.100
Next time on Konjiki no Gash Bell:
Elite Demon Eshuros!

00:22:59.310 --> 00:23:01.980
I like your kind heart!

00:23:01.980 --> 00:23:04.980
Elite Demon Eshuros
